<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.62 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.81 vs   0.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.01 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Sales		   13.56 vs  12.46</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.42 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.29 vs   1.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.85 vs   1.95</p>
<p> Sales		   35.50 vs  29.61</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is</p>
<p>Olsztynskie Zaklady Drobiarskie Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
